   189	has class `dA+3B`; if it is smooth and irreducible, adjunction gives
   190	
   191	```text
   192	K_(X_d)=(d-3)A+B.                                    (4.1)
   193	```
   194	
   195	For `d>=3`, restriction of ambient sections gives
   196	
