+# Hostile review: singular F5 local polar and A6/A7 elimination
+
+Date: 2026-08-30 UTC
+Reviewer: GPT-5.5 xhigh, independent hostile audit
+Charged basis: `2275c1f490517e844572f7b532bde36ecce8cc20`
