+## 7. The `B3/A2` modulus
+
+Verdict: **CONFIRM_WITH_CORRECTIONS**.
+
+For `B_3/A_2`, write
+
+```text
+v_0=tau z+O(z^2),       sigma=1-tau,       sigma!=0.
+```
