+## 3. Newton/Hensel factorization and A-degrees
+
+Verdict: **CONFIRMED**.
+
+The first lower edge has initial polynomial
+
+```text
+X^3-lambda zX^2 = X^2(X-lambda z),
+lambda!=0.
+```
+
+The nonzero root is simple, hence gives one reduced smooth strict germ
